  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In &nbsp;<math><mo>∆</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/27433__CA_soludddd.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 170px;\" /><br /><br /><br />In &nbsp;<math><mo>∆</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;tan&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(i)<br /><br /><math><mo>∵&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> (<math><mo>∵</mo><mi>C</mi></math> is the mid point of <math><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></math>)<br /><br />From Eq. (i), we get<br /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mrow></math>",
